  "notes": "{埋|う}める is an ichidan verb meaning to bury, fill in, or cover completely.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{埋|う}まる→埋まる：01897_umaru⟧ (intransitive: to be buried, to be filled)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{穴|あな}→穴：01691_ana⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{埋|う}める: to fill a hole\n- ⟦{空白|くうはく}→空白：15426_kuuhaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{埋|う}める: to fill in blanks\n- ⟦{差|さ}→差：02771_sa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{埋|う}める: to close a gap\n- ⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{埋|う}める: to fill time\n- ⟦{損失|そんしつ}→損失：04875_sonshitsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{埋|う}める: to make up for a loss\n\nUSAGE:\nOften used figuratively for \"filling\" abstract gaps like time, deficits, or differences.",
